"The MagiPhys Gym at Celena North High was built by Artonans and is unbreakable."
"With the floor on, it blocks serious harm; pain feels real but fades within ten seconds."
"Injury realism is set between 40 and 75 percent, or can run with no reduction at all."
"Rank letters glow green for full force or yellow for no head shots."
"It registers kills, and can raise light walls and dueling blocks."
"Users must wear self-sealing gray bodysuits with red-inlaid metal cuffs, or risk losing limbs."
"A deliberately lethal hit gets a student expelled and named to every Apex school."
